# Questions Folder
# 
# This folder is excluded from Git (.gitignore) because files are too large.
# 
# Files in this folder are:
# 1. Stored locally for development
# 2. Uploaded to Vercel Blob via: npm run upload:blob
# 3. Referenced via public/blob-mapping.json (which IS committed to Git)
#
# Workflow:
# - Add new question files here locally
# - Run: npm run upload:blob
# - Commit: public/blob-mapping.json (contains Blob URLs)
# - Files are served from Blob in production, local in development

